{
 "encounter_id": "00557",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Pain, doctor. Very bad pain on the right side of my stomach."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay. I'm here now. Tell me about it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Since morning. First near the navel, then it moved to the right side."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Mm-hm."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What does it feel like?",
   "pause": 6
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Sharp. Like a knife. When I walk, it is worse."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Would you call it mild, moderate or severe?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Severe."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I see. What else has been happening?",
   "pause": 5
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Vomiting. Two times, at home. And nausea, all the time."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And what about your appetite, how has that been?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Not eating. Since... I don't know. Maybe two days, maybe four. I can't say exactly."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's all right. Any loose motions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And any problems with passing urine?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Normal."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you have any illness you are being treated for?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Diabetes. Sugar problem."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What do you take for the diabetes?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Metformin. Maybe 500 milligrams? Morning and night. I do not remember properly."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Fine. Have you had any operations in the past?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Tonsils. When I was ten."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "All right. Lie back and bend your knees. I am going to press on your tummy, and you tell me where it hurts."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Here?",
   "pause": 8
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Aah! There. Yes, there."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Tender in the lower right side of your abdomen, and I can feel the muscles tightening under my hand. You can relax now."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Doctor, is it serious?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me finish the checks first. I will read your numbers."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pressure 118 over 74. Pulse 104. Temperature 38.1.",
   "pause": 12
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Oxygen saturation 98 per cent, and breathing rate 20 per minute."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is the fever also from this?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It can be. Putting it together, this looks like appendicitis, the appendix being inflamed. I want to confirm it today."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Appendix. My cousin had that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It is common. First I would like blood tests now, to look for infection."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay, doctor."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Then we will do an ultrasound scan of your abdomen, today itself."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Scan also."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes. And let's get a urine test, to be sure nothing else is going on."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I will ask the surgical team to see you once the scan is done. Until then, please do not eat or drink anything."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Not even water?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Not even water. You can wet your lips."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Will they operate today?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I cannot say yet. The surgeons will decide after the scan. I will not leave you without telling you what is happening."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. My wife is outside. Can she come in?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes, I will call her. She can sit with you while we wait for the test."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Thank you, doctor."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Try to stay still. The nurse will be with you in a minute."
  }
